  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together curry paste, lime juice, fish sauce, and vegetable oil.",
    "3. Add the fish cubes to the marinade and mix well.",
    "4. Thread the marinated fish, bell peppers, onions, and basil onto skewers.",
    "5. Brush the skewers with vegetable oil and season with salt and pepper.",
    "6. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "7. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
